<div style="color:#666;line-height:1.35;margin-top:4px;">The figure is drawn in the textbook's oblique (cabinet) projection: Y up, Z to the right, X receding up&#8209;right. Drag on it — or press <b>3D&nbsp;view</b> — to un&#8209;shear it into a true perspective-free 3D view; <b>Figure view</b> / <b>Reset View</b> brings the printed pose back.</div>
